msgstr "Nuage de liquide de refroidissement. Sors-en."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). It: the sentry.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5513
msgid "It's after you. Get back over the rubble."
msgstr "La sentinelle te poursuit. Repasse derrière les décombres."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). It: the sentry; the mark is the painted spot under the tank.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5518
msgid "Wait for WOLF to park it on the mark."
msgstr "Attends que WOLF amène la sentinelle sur le repère."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). %s is the key, button or touch word the player uses (it is filled in after translation); keep it first and keep the colon. It: the sentry.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:5518
#, c-format
msgid "%s: drop the tank. It's parked on the mark."
msgstr "%s : lâche le réservoir. La sentinelle est sur le repère."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). %s is the key, button or touch word the player uses (it is filled in after translation); keep it first and keep the colon.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:5519
#, c-format
msgid "%s: drop the tank. Land it with the sentry on the mark."
msgstr "%s : lâche le réservoir quand la sentinelle est sur le repère."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint
#: scripts/main.gd:5521
msgid "The tank is falling."
msgstr "Le réservoir tombe."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5523
msgid "The winch is hauling the tank back up. Wait for the clamp."
msgstr "Le treuil remonte le réservoir. Attends la pince."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). It: the sentry.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5525
msgid "Stay back over the rubble until it gives up."
msgstr "Reste derrière les décombres jusqu'à ce qu'elle abandonne."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR, a proposal of the open glossary term (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5527
msgid "You're in its sights. Hide at the TANK RELEASE or the rubble."
msgstr "La sentinelle t'a en ligne de mire. Cache-toi au LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR ou derrière les décombres."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR, a proposal of the open glossary term (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5529
msgid "WOLF is drawing the sentry onto the mark. Get to the TANK RELEASE."
msgstr "WOLF attire la sentinelle sur le repère. Va au LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR, a proposal of the open glossary term (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen). Its patrol: the sentry's.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5531
msgid "WOLF has broken off. Time the drop on its patrol from the TANK RELEASE."
msgstr "WOLF abandonne. Depuis le LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR, cale le largage sur la ronde de la sentinelle."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR, a proposal of the open glossary term (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5532
msgid "The sentry patrols past the rubble. The TANK RELEASE hides you from it."
msgstr "La sentinelle patrouille au-delà des décombres. Le LARGAGE RÉSERVOIR te cache d'elle."

